Neo4j database configuration

Usage:
  eshu neo4j [command]

Available Commands:
  setup       Configure Neo4j database connection

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for neo4j

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu neo4j [command] --help" for more information about a command.
